00:23:15.560 --> 00:23:20.590
Playing around, tonight's evening
concert will be

00:23:20.590 --> 00:23:25.270
The aridness of nature which lurks
in the warmth

00:23:20.730 --> 00:23:25.470
<i>Nukumorini hisomu yaseino kawaki</i>

00:23:25.270 --> 00:23:26.470
OH- AH-

00:23:25.470 --> 00:23:26.640
<i>OH-AH-</i>

00:23:26.470 --> 00:23:31.440
