00:23:26.640 --> 00:23:31.540
<i>Hitsuyouna youbunwa takusan arisugiruto</i>

00:23:31.440 --> 00:23:35.410
They become divided based on
how sweet it is

00:23:31.540 --> 00:23:35.450
