00:24:40.310 --> 00:24:55.210
<i>Next Episode
Shell of Destruction</i>

00:24:41.810 --> 00:24:43.480
There's a warrant out for our arrest.

00:24:43.480 --> 00:24:45.950
There's absolutely nothing we can do,
but that's not stopping Mikura.

00:24:45.950 --> 00:24:47.610
It's a battle to see whose level of evil is greater!

00:24:47.610 --> 00:24:49.750
Let's do it! Do something about it! What?

00:24:49.750 --> 00:24:51.390
The next episode is the last one? Hello?

00:24:51.390 --> 00:24:53.150
What? Mikura hasn't rampaged enough?

00:24:53.150 --> 00:24:55.210
Then next time, we'll put her on
the big screen. Seriously?
